<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: October 26, 2025</p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>Verify My Collectible ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our Shopify application.</p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you install and use our app, we may collect the following information:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Store Information:</strong> Your Shopify store domain, store name, and email address</li>
      <li><strong>Product Data:</strong> Information about your collectible items including names, serial numbers, descriptions, and images</li>
      <li><strong>Category Data:</strong> Categories you create to organize your collectibles</li>
      <li><strong>Verification Logs:</strong> IP addresses and timestamps of when customers verify collectibles</li>
      <li><strong>Subscription Information:</strong> Your billing plan and subscription status</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>To provide and maintain our service</li>
      <li>To manage your collectible inventory and verification system</li>
      <li>To process billing and subscriptions</li>
      <li>To improve our app and user experience</li>
      <li>To provide customer support</li>
      <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
    <p>Your data is stored securely on Amazon Web Services (AWS) infrastructure in the United States. We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.</p>

    <h2>5. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
    <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information only in the following circumstances:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>With Shopify:</strong> As necessary to provide the app services through the Shopify platform</li>
      <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> With trusted third-party service providers who assist in operating our app (e.g., AWS for hosting)</li>
      <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law or to protect our rights</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
    <p>You have the following rights regarding your data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request access to your personal data</li>
      <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
      <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your data by uninstalling the app</li>
      <li><strong>Export:</strong> Request a copy of your data</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain your data for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide you services. When you uninstall the app, we will delete your data within 48 hours, except where we are required to retain it for legal purposes.</p>

    <h2>8. GDPR Compliance</h2>
    <p>If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), you have additional rights under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR):</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Right to access your personal data</li>
      <li>Right to rectification of inaccurate data</li>
      <li>Right to erasure ("right to be forgotten")</li>
      <li>Right to restrict processing</li>
      <li>Right to data portability</li>
      <li>Right to object to processing</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our app is not intended for use by children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>

    <h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date.</p>

    <h2>11. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>Our app integrates with Shopify and uses the following third-party services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Shopify:</strong> For app hosting and merchant authentication</li>
      <li><strong>Amazon Web Services (AWS):</strong> For secure data storage</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="contact">
      <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:</p>
      <p>
        <strong>Email:</strong> privacy@verifymycollectible.com<br>
        <strong>Website:</strong> https://verifymycollectible.com
      </p>
    </div>
